16:["$","p",null,{"children":"A professional tax invoice helps both seller and buyer. The seller gets a clear record of the sale and payment due. The buyer gets a document showing what was purchased, what GST was charged and what amount should be paid. In B2B transactions, buyer GSTIN and tax breakup are especially important."}]
